    // TS_GridColumns_v1.tt
    // Generates: grid-columns.ts and grid-columns.spec.ts   (point the output folder at the Angular app's src\app folder; the components import it as '../../grid-columns')
    // The shared helpers of the Columns list every Angular grid (REST and OData) has: the saved choice of columns (browser local storage, one list of names per grid), the rule that reads it back
    // (ChosenGridColumns.Resolve in Core), the tick-or-clear rule, the cut of a long text cell, and GridColumns, the object a screen holds: the columns shown, the sortable ones and the properties
    // an OData page reads, each kept as one array that is updated in place so a screen can hand it to its base class once. One file for the whole project.
    // Full notes: Docs/TemplateNotes/TS_GridColumns_v1.md

    Write("@@@FILE grid-columns.ts@@@\n");
